      "symbol": "max() / min() of non-numbers",
      "php": "mixed values compare with zend_compare (strings, arrays, booleans, null)",
      "reason": "php_std::format::max/min take numbers, the only values the libraries pass; mixed comparison belongs to a zend_compare port"
    },
