      "symbol": "sprintf() 'Unknown format specifier' with a non-ASCII byte",
      "php": "the exception message holds the raw byte, which is not valid UTF-8",
      "reason": "php_std::string::Error messages are UTF-8 strings; the byte is replaced by U+FFFD"
    },
    {
      "symbol": "sprintf() field widths of 2^31 - 1 bytes or more",
      "php": "a fatal error (Field width ... is too long) that ends the process",
